578],{},"value",", set them with ",[303,581,582],{},"label-key",[303,584,585],{},"value-key",". Props of ",[303,588,589],{},"USelectMenu"," such as ",[303,592,593],{},"description-key"," work directly too; field names are inferred from ",[303,596,435],{},", and a wrong name is a type error.",[351,599],{"name":600},"select-menu-keys",[325,602,604],{"id":603},"search","Search",[300,606,607,608,611,612,614,615,618],{},"The menu has a built-in search input with the placeholder \"Search...\" (\"關鍵字查詢...\" in Traditional Chinese), which can be changed in ",[312,609,47],{"href":610},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages#overridable-items",". The search matches the ",[303,613,582],{}," field and is not affected by the display format. With only a few items, pass ",[303,616,617],{},":search-input=\"false\""," to hide the search input.",[351,620],{"name":621},"select-menu-search",[325,623,625],{"id":624},"variants","Variants",[300,627,628,629,632,633,370,636,639,640,349],{},"Uses the ",[303,630,631],{},"variant",", ",[303,634,635],{},"color",[303,637,638],{},"highlight"," of ",[303,641,589],{},[351,643],{"name":644},"select-menu-variant",[325,646,648],{"id":647},"icon","Icon",[300,650,628,651,370,653,639,656,658,659,661,662,664],{},[303,652,647],{},[303,654,655],{},"trailing-icon",[303,657,589],{},"; ",[303,660,647],{}," shows on the left, and ",[303,663,655],{}," replaces the arrow on the right.",[351,666],{"name":667},"select-menu-icon",[325,669,671],{"id":670},"size-and-states","Size and states",[300,673,674,675,678],{},"While loading, a spinner replaces the arrow on the right and the menu is disabled. Switching to skeleton, disabled or loading closes an open menu, and it does not reopen afterwards. See ",[312,676,102],{"href":677},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[351,680],{"name":681},"select-menu-states",[320,683,685],{"id":684},"examples","Examples",[325,687,689],{"id":688},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[300,691,692,693,695,696,699,700,695,702,349],{},"An empty single selection is ",[303,694,340],{},", so use ",[303,697,698],{},"requiredText","; an empty multiple selection is ",[303,701,348],{},[303,703,704],{},"requiredArray",[351,706],{"name":707},"select-menu-validation",[325,709,711],{"id":710},"truncated-text-tooltip","Truncated text tooltip",[300,713,714,715,718,719,310,722,726],{},"When the selected text is wider than the field, it is truncated with an ellipsis, and a tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[312,716,217],{"href":717},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the menu. The tooltip is not shown while the menu is open. Set the width on ",[303,720,721],{},"ui.wrapper",[312,723,725],{"href":724},"#styling","Styling"," below.",[351,728],{"name":729},"select-menu-truncate",[325,731,733],{"id":732},"loading-items-asynchronously","Loading items asynchronously",[300,735,736,737,740,741,743,744,747],{},"While fetching items from the back end, use ",[303,738,739],{},"loading"," to show a spinner and disable the menu, then fill in ",[303,742,435],{}," when the request completes. When the bound value has no matching item, ",[303,745,746],{},"placeholder"," is shown, and the label appears automatically once the items arrive.",[351,749],{"name":750},"select-menu-async",[325,752,754],{"id":753},"dependent-menus","Dependent menus",[300,756,757,758,760],{},"When the city changes, the district is cleared, and the district ",[303,759,435],{}," are computed from the city.",[351,762],{"name":763},"select-menu-cascade",[325,765,767],{"id":766},"opening-the-menu","Opening the menu",[300,769,770,771,774,775,778],{},"Get the trigger button through ",[303,772,773],{},"triggerRef"," on the template ref and call ",[303,776,777],{},"click()"," to open the menu.",[351,780],{"name":781},"select-menu-expose",[320,783,785],{"id":784},"props","Props",[787,788],"compon